{% comment %}
  Magic Rag redemption page — native rebuild of the live /mg page (audit
  target: live capture 2026-09-18). Same pattern as main-warranty.liquid:
  the live page has no AKDY-built content of its own — the entire body
  below the breadcrumb is a NetSuite "External Lead Page" form (Online
  Lead Form, compid 4480470, formid 22), embedded as a 100% x 1000px
  iframe:

    https://4480470.extforms.netsuite.com/app/site/crm/externalleadpage.nl
      ?compid=4480470&formid=22&h=AAFdikaIsm5ygDWBof3lnLk3F7q-fpwS53E4Qce2PJDO9zbVmAU

  This is the "Magic Rag" review-redemption form: customer enters their
  order number, what they bought, where they bought it, a review nickname
  and a link to the review they posted, plus contact/shipping info — likely
  reached via a QR code on the product's packaging, same as the Gift page.
  Kept on the same NetSuite form for the same reason as Warranty: the
  workflow keeps working exactly as it does today, no backend decision
  needed. The iframe URL is a section setting so it can be swapped without
  a code change.

  Full field list (in case a native Shopify form ever replaces it) is in
  docs/policy-page-content/magic-rag-form-fields.md.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="container">
  {% render 'breadcrumbs' %}

  <div class="magic-rag">
    <h1 class="page-title sr-only">{{ page.title }}</h1>

    {%- if section.settings.intro != blank -%}
      <div class="magic-rag-intro">{{ section.settings.intro }}</div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.settings.form_url != blank -%}
      <iframe
        class="magic-rag-form-frame"
        src="{{ section.settings.form_url }}"
        title="{{ section.settings.form_title | default: 'AKDY Magic Rag Redemption' }}"
        width="100%"
        height="{{ section.settings.form_height | default: 1000 }}"
        loading="lazy">
      </iframe>
    {%- else -%}
      <p class="magic-rag-form-missing" data-todo="magic-rag-form-url">Magic Rag redemption form is not configured yet.</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Magic Rag",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "intro",
      "label": "Intro text",
      "info": "Optional AKDY-side copy above the form. The live page has none — the NetSuite form has its own banner/intro baked in — so this is blank by default."
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "form_url",
      "label": "Redemption form embed URL",
      "default": "https://4480470.extforms.netsuite.com/app/site/crm/externalleadpage.nl?compid=4480470&formid=22&h=AAFdikaIsm5ygDWBof3lnLk3F7q-fpwS53E4Qce2PJDO9zbVmAU",
      "info": "The live NetSuite lead-form URL. Same backend as today — swap this if the form is ever rebuilt or the link token changes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "form_title",
      "label": "Iframe accessible title",
      "default": "AKDY Magic Rag Redemption"
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "id": "form_height",
      "label": "Iframe height (px)",
      "default": 1000,
      "info": "Matches the live embed's fixed height (1000px)."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Magic Rag"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
